```bash
grep -rE "Result<[^>]*, String>" backend/crates --include="*.rs" | wc -l
grep -rE "use thiserror" backend/crates --include="*.rs" | wc -l
```

**判定**:第一条 ≤ 50 → `[x]`(允许 Tauri 命令边界保留)

