```rust
#[derive(Debug, thiserror::Error)]
pub enum PentestError {
    #[error("preflight failed: {0}")]
    Preflight(String),
    #[error("io: {0}")]
    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),
    #[error("db: {0}")]
    Db(#[from] sqlx::Error),
}
pub type PentestResult<T> = Result<T, PentestError>;
```
2. 全 crate 用 `sed`/codemod 把 `Result<T, String>` 替换为 `Result<T, PentestError>`
3. `lib.rs` `pub use error::*;`

**目标顺序**:`golish-pentest` → `golish-vuln-intel` → `golish-pipeline` → `golish-scan-runner` → `golish-projects` → `golish-indexer` → `golish-mcp` → `golish-sub-agents`

